S The next step towards achieving this goal would be to gather information on certain aspects relating to his " pictured " solution .

S For example , if his idea is to produce plants which give much greater yield , he needs to assess the yield of existing plants .

S From that point onwards he could design different possible approaches to what he expects to do .

