S Social determinant in shaping nuclear technology

S Nuclear technology refers to technology that " involves the reaction of atomic nuclei " ( Wikipedia , n.d. ) .

S It may appear as a high-tech term but in fact it has been put into use in various areas : radiometric dating , food irradiation , x-ray and chemotherapy in medicine and so on .
