S Yet , as a powerful technology , many applications of this technology have been limited due to political , environmental and economical factors .

S Like many other technologies , nuclear technology first came into use to meet military demands .

S Since nuclear weapons are of mass destruction , policymakers of countries all over the world prohibit research of nuclear technology 's application in military aspect and a non-proliferation treaty has been open for signature since 1968 ( International Atomic Energy Agency , 1970 ) .
