S Problems to Engineering Design in Singapore

S Living in a small country like Singapore has various limitations and thus more challenging for her to compete with larger nations .
A 10 12|||R:OTHER|||is|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Several of these limitations significantly affect the design process of new innovations .

