S Second , the qualities of the materials are not steady .
A 3 8|||R:OTHER|||quality of the materials is|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 9 10|||R:ADJ|||consistent|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S This is mainly due to our production system is not advanced .
A 5 5|||M:OTHER|||the fact that|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S We do not have the advanced equipment and do not use stabilizing agent and additive properly .

S This problem is because of our short comings in the technology .
A 9 10|||U:DET||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S The last , the price of the raw materials fluctuate greatly .
A 9 10|||R:VERB:SVA|||fluctuates|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S The price of the ordinary materials are suitable and almost the same as other countries .
A 6 7|||R:VERB:SVA|||is|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
