S Technology has played a significant role in moulding our lives .

S As long as we seek to improve our lives , technology will always exist .

S However , this is a period of time where technology will be important in helping mankind to survive on this planet .

S Global warming has been identified as one of the greatest threat to our survival , and engineers have tried to solve this issue by coming up with green technology such as solar panels , windmills and dams .

