S This is because the innovation in technology is not only technologically decisive but also socially decisive .

S Social factors include economic factors , military demands , government regulations and so on .

S Usually , a new technology will be tested by more than one factor and the results will directly affect the future of the new technology .

S Firstly , the new technology must satisfy consumer 's needs .
