S Radio Frequency Identification ( RFID ) is an automatic identification system that is used to identify people and items by the transmission of radio waves ( DiLorenzo , 2008 ) .

S The use of RFID to track people has invaded privacy and caused a breach to security .

S In addition , human implantation of RFID may bring about health and medical problems .

S Therefore , the use of RFID to track people should be banned as it would bring about negative impacts to the society .
