S Some suggest application of surveillance technology is advantageous in the safeguard of credentials , protection of national security and enhancement of business and commerce sectors .

S However the same technology can also be used to track people and intrude private information .
A 1 1|||M:PUNCT|||,|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
