S An electronic card embedded with a Radio Frequency Identification ( RFID ) chip was used to monitor the movements of patients , healthcare workers , and visitors within a hospital ( Defense Science and Technology Agency , 2003 ) .

S This system resulted in an increased efficiency of the contact tracing process and quarantine procedures when a patient was confirmed with SARS .

S Contact tracing and quarantine procedures would normally take two days with the previous method ; it was also more taxing on manpower .
