A 24 30|||U:OTHER||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S In conclusion , the individual requesting genetic testing should not have the final say as to whether the results should be revealed or not as the benefits of revealing the results is substantial to the individual and his family , and it can not be assumed that the individual will be able to act responsibly to his family in the face of his own interests .

