S The main reason is that even if older workers want to work , the deciding factor still lies with the employers .

S In fact , stipulating higher retirement age can have an adverse effect .

S Employers now think twice before employing or retaining older workers due to the potential higher liability and costs such as retraining programs and insurance benefits .

S As a result , employers tend to shut their doors to the older workers .
