S The elderly would therefore be at the suffering end .

S While this may indeed happen , the situation can still be remedied .

S Additional profits reaped from the investment in other areas of the country 's development could in turn contribute to the public spending significantly .
A 19 22|||R:OTHER|||on the elderly|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S In fact , it is inevitable for the government to divert money to the other areas of development as aging population has affected these areas significantly .
A 19 19|||M:DET|||an|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
