A 4 6|||U:OTHER||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S The additional profits reaped from this investment may in turn regenerate to the public funds to help the needy ones , including the elderly .
A 10 11|||R:VERB|||be re-channeled|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Hence , the investments in other areas of the country 's development would not be at expense of the needs of the elderly ; in actual fact , it could create a win-win situation .
