A 28 29|||R:PRON|||they|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S In addition , limiting the public spending on the aged and diverting resources to other areas may not necessarily mean that the government is neglecting the needs of the elderly .

S Government is still taking care of the aged from various aspects .
