S Through amelioration and subsidizing of healthcare and public facilities the process of aging population has been eased .

S Through amelioration and subsidizing of healthcare and public facilities the process of aging population has been eased .
A 9 9|||M:PUNCT|||,|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
