A 28 29|||R:VERB:SVA|||has|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 37 37|||M:DET|||a|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Hence , policy such as senior citizens ' bonus the where lower-income elderly aged 55 and above with an annual income of $ 100,000 or less will receive $ 200 to $ 1000 over a period of 4 years ( as cited in GST Offset Package , 2009 ) to lighten the burden of lower income families .
A 2 3|||R:NOUN:NUM|||policies|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 9 10|||U:DET||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S There is no need to worry as statistic shows that direct subsidies to patients have increase from $ 850 million in 2001 to $ 1.6 billion in 2007 and it is project to increase to $ 2.2 billion in 2012 ( as cited in Ministry of Health , 2009 ) .
