S When Singapore 's Ministry of Finance unveiled the government budget for 2009 , it is stated that an estimated total of S $ 66 million or 0.15 % of the total government expenditure will be spent on establishing various programs and upgrading facilities for the elderly ( Singapore Budget 2009 , 2009 ) .
