A 9 10|||R:PREP|||of|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 15 16|||R:VERB|||might|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Bigger families require bigger homes at steep prices which force couples to reconsider about the decision to have more children .
A 13 14|||U:PREP||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Is it possible for a couple to purchase a spacious and comfortable place at an affordable price for a family of five ?

