S In addition there will be a minimization of a risk of failing healthcare system as there is enough time to make changes and gradually adapt to it .
A 26 27|||R:PRON|||them|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S However , there is a risk involved to limiting spending on the aged .
