S Expanding the economy is a more effective strategy to ease the aging process compared to simply giving out public pension to the elderly .

S For those countries with aging process , the biggest problem they have to face is the number of labors who can work and create values keeps on shrinking ( A Touch of Gray , 2002 ) .
