S In this way , they would have the proficiency to deal with any problems that may arise .

S Nonetheless , it could be refuted that this might promote job hoping .
A 11 12|||R:MORPH|||hopping|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S With the new skills and knowledge obtained , individuals would hunt for better paying and quality jobs .

S Ilana ( 2001 ) claimed that people who possessed the essential skills would change occupations due to the lucrative salary offered by different companies .

S However , funding of training programmes should still proceed as it would increase the productivity and capability of the working population in handling any challenges there might surface in the future .
