S While it results in a delay to the country 's economic progress , the problem also imposes a burden to the children as well .

S Thus , this highlights the need for effective policies and research to be implemented and conducted , in order to cushion the negative impacts of aging process .

S Three significant solutions would be , improve economy , introduce elderly-friendly infrastructure and appropriate financial subsidies .
