S Therefore , establishment of accessible infrastructure helps the elderly to adjust more easily .

S Financial subsidies would also help to lessen the dependency of the elderly on their children .

S As elderly productivity decreases with age , the ability to command the same income as before is almost impossible .

S Hence , they would have difficulty maintaining their standard of living .

S Therefore , appropriate financial assistances are recommended to help cope with their essential needs .
