S Australia is a welfare state that strongly emphasise the well-being of the elderly .
A 7 8|||R:VERB:SVA|||emphasises|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Policies such as age pensions and medical benefits allow her aged to receive sufficient assistances to cope with the financial needs ( Greg , 2003 ) .
