A 6 7|||R:VERB:TENSE|||is|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S This act is a new policy mentioned by Prime Minister Lee during the National Day Rally Speech 2009 .
A 17 18|||R:OTHER|||in|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S It mainly acts on cases where the younger generations abandon their parents .
