A 3 4|||R:PREP|||for|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S This way , it will ensure that the parents are not being abandoned by their children .

S However , we also have to take into consideration that the children might have reasons for not supporting their parents .

S One very good example was mentioned in a Channel Newsasia article ( " Social sector wants govt " , august 2009 ) .
A 11 21|||U:OTHER||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

