A 30 30|||M:OTHER|||be on|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S This , coupled with other initiatives such as the workfare to older workers and incentives for companies to hire elderly workers , serves to encourage longer working lives and decrease dependency among elderly workers .
A 9 13|||UNK||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

