S Therefore , careful planning and development of the transportation system are crucial .

S More money should be used to develop this infrastructure in order to support the moving of goods from one place to another efficiently and effectively .

S Parking space is another concern .

S For example , in Singapore where land scarcity poses a big issue , multi-storey carparks are built to allow more vehicles to be parked given the same land area used .

