S As the saying goes " Time and tide wait for no man " , ageing is an inevitable process one has to face .

S As an individual grows older , one will become more susceptible to various ailments and diseases that may render one incapacitated in some way or other .

S ( Illnesses of The Elderly , 2008 ) .

S Moreover , one will become physically weak as one aged and this will lead a higher tendency to cause a lesion in oneself .
