S With the help of bio-technology , various types of massaging equipments and machines have been invented to ease the process of ageing .

S This technology usually helps to ameliorate the health of users such as improving blood circulation , which helps users to have a healthier body ; especially for elders who tend to have weaker bodies .

S As these equipments or machines may calm down , give strength , relax the body , improves self-sensation and trigger regeneration mechanisms ( The " Medical Club Ltd " , 2008 ) .

S For example , OSIM has come up with many innovative healthy lifestyle products that provide such benefits .

S In addition , there is a robotic suit that reads brain signals and helps people with mobility problem ( The " NursingTimes " , Robotic Suit Aims to Aid Mobility in the Elderly , 2009 ) launching in Japan, .
