S To summarize , even though there are some disadvantages pertaining to cost and indirect negative effects , it is definitely beneficial for the elders and disabled to a huge extent .

S Thus , it is important to keep improving our current research on technological inventions and government policies on architecture that have helped to ease the ageing process , as the benefits are definitely worth the cost .

S As many believe health is wealth , if spending a little more could give the elders a healthy lifestyle , everything is worthwhile .

