S Other than that , with the current pace that the world is in now , medicine , architecture and social policies must work hand-in-hand to establish a sense of security for the older generation .

S If we do not pay attention to the needs of the older generation , we would be considered as people with no sense of appreciation to what the older generation has done for us .

