S In Singapore , this particular self-funded retirement scheme is called " CPF Contributions " .

S This is where the employer and employee have to provide monetary contributions for that particular employee 's CPF account .

S Apart from this , there are additional or related schemes such as Medisave and Medishield .

S Britain , Australia , Chile have also moved towards this kind of funded retirement schemes .

