S Due to the high standards of living , the huge medical expenses incurred by the elderly not only strain their children emotionally , but financially as well .

S To address this issue , the government came up with the Primary Care Partnership Scheme ( 2008 ) where subsidies are given out accordingly after an income assessment is done .

S However , I believe this is insufficient due to the stringent criteria placed on the Per Capita Income Rate of Subsidy .
A 2 6|||R:OTHER|||this may be|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

