S First , modern medicine is now able to cure or treat many diseases that were once terminal .
A 0 1|||R:MORPH|||Firstly|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S When the first colonists traveled to the New World during the 15th and 16th centuries , they not only carried with them novelty items like horses and guns , they also carried new diseases .

S For example , smallpox , from which many Europeans were immune , decimated the native populations of America and the Caribbean because the Indians had no immunity to a disease they had never experienced before .

S Today , modern medicine can even prolong the lives of people who have diseases for which we do not yet have a cure .
