S " ( CNN-IBN , 2007 ) .

S The revenue involved in this widespread mishap is very high , thereby affecting all the facets of the country .

S Even the poverty stricken section of the society is forced to bribe the officials for their living .

S Right from education every other field in India is flooded with corrupt officials who primarily work with a self centered mindset to misappropriate and amass huge amount of money .
A 25 25|||M:DET|||a|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

