S This multi faceted economic problem poses as the main hindrance to India 's technological development and is the mother of all other social and political problems that India faces .
A 5 7|||R:OTHER|||becomes|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Despite having morbid and influential problems , population and corruption , India is still a fore runner in the economic scenario and has a steady development rate .

