S However , the engineering design process for innovation has been hampered in my home country , Malaysia .

S According to the The 6th International Malaysian Studies Conference 2008 , " it is true that Malaysian SMEs do not see innovation as part of their business " .

S In my home country , I feel that the 2 main problems that affect the engineering design processes for innovation hampered are the lack of government support in engineering innovative design area and social problem .
