S Since China has developed a lot in the last decade , its economic strength has increased significantly .

S However , as President Hu ( 2007 ) says in the Seventeenth National People 's Congress , China is still weak in independent innovation .

S Since then , it became a big task to implementing the strategy of putting a lot of efforts in technological advancement .
