S In Singapore , there are various problems that may significantly hamper engineering design processes for innovations .

S These problems comprise of , insufficient funds , insufficient resources , design may not be aesthetically pleasing to be selected and copyright infringement .
A 3 4|||U:PREP||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Of these four identified problems , I would highlight two of them and the effects that they had on certain stages of the process .
