S The idea of making a laptop was inspired by mainly three social factors : demand of customers , support of technical stuff , and source of funding .

S Firstly , the demand for a convenient and cheap computer grew rapidly at the beginning of 1980s .

S At that time , there were very few people owning a personal computer at home , as the price of a computer was much higher than what the workers could afford .

S Most of the computers were offered by the companies as office supplies .

