A 7 7|||M:DET|||the|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 8 10|||R:VERB:TENSE|||was|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Secondly , the man power that provides technological support plays an essential rule to the innovation of laptop .
A 3 4|||R:OTHER|||main|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
