A 18 19|||R:VERB:FORM|||generate|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S More advertising sponsors will be attracted to employ their services , and hence , sustain YouTube 's continual success .

S Youtube has grown so much that it became part of many people 's media entertainment and web surfing experience .

S With its huge influence on the cyber community , it might even become a platform which in turn will help shape our society in the future .

