S One example would be Mac laptop and Toshiba laptop .

S Mac laptop was created by Apple in a conventional way whereas Toshiba laptop , the first laptop in the world , was produced in a skunkworks environment .

S We may evaluate both of them by investigating their designs , durability , and portability .

S As laptop is created for the convenience of the customers , both Mac laptop and Toshiba laptop are similar in their portability .

S Being the first laptop producer , Toshiba was successful in turning the idea of portable computer into reality .

S The smallest laptop it produced , Toshiba 's Libretto U100-S213 , has only the size of 21.0 x 3.33 x16.51 cm and weight of 2.2 pounds .
A 22 23|||R:OTHER|||weighs|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
