S Our government does in fact provides some kind of incentives to researchers .
A 5 6|||R:VERB:SVA|||provide|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S In short , although the ageing population and the mindset of Singaporeans may prove to be a challenge to engineers , it is possible to overcome them .

S Engineers must be open to new ideas , adept to their target consumers and be willing to take risks .

S The movie star , Paul Newman said , " I never learnt as much in the classroom as I did staring out a window and imagining things .

S " ( Yue Sun , p.184 ) Generally , design is a process of an imagination being produced by a human .
