S However , by producing an innovative product on the market , it is not an easy task to achieve .

S Most of the time , it is often hindered by multiple realistic problems .

S There are two major problems which hamper engineering design processes for innovation .

S The first problem is due to government related issues while the second is related to the environmental issues .
