S Firstly , from the technical perspective , the invention of magnetic stripe card technology makes it possible that credit card itself can record data of receipts and disbursements .

S Moreover , computer technology and network technology broaden the range of credit card 's service and make a strong link between the card and our daily life .
A 7 8|||R:VERB:TENSE|||broadened|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 13 14|||U:NOUN:POSS||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
