S Statistics have shown that over the past decade , the percentage of elderly has risen from 7.0 % in 1999 to 7.8 % in 2004 .

S Till last year in 2008 , it has hit the highest proportion of elderly ever seen - A shocking proportion of 8.7 % ( Singapore Government Statistics , 2009 ) .
