S First of all , the most practical part of solution is to make full use of energy .

S The phenomena of energy wasting can be found everywhere in daily life .

S Even the industrial design can not avoid it .

S For instance , most vehicles ' engines can only transfer about 30 % of fuel 's chemical energy into mechanical energy , while the other 70 % becoming heat and polluters .

S Another example comes from the solar panel .

S Although solar energy has been regarded as the most promising energy form , solar panel is also well known for its low energy exchange rate-less than 16 % .

S However , if the effectiveness of both energy use and production can be improved , enormous amount of energy could be saved .

S The following efforts should be put into storing and accumulating small portions of energy .

S As the major energy resources are running out , more and more energy comes from those resources which can only generate a little energy at a time .
