A 11 12|||R:PREP|||to|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Moreover , with these technologies , man-power is saved and efficiency of work is increased .

S Thus , technologies discovered in these two ways have the same goal , which is to improve the quality of our life .

S However , despite of the similarities , they also have differences , which mainly fall in two aspects .

S Firstly , refrigerator has a strong purpose in real life before it is invented .
