S However , the process of finding the technology of microwave oven was by chance and took a very short time , and it might even be ignored if people did not pay attention to the phenomena .

S Therefore , developing a technology by research may require more work and developing a technology serendipitously will need more attention to details in daily life .

S In conclusion , though differences exist during the processes they are developed , in the aspects of their use and in the marketing potential when the equipment comes out , both kinds of technologies contribute to the development of the society .

