S By contrast , conventional technologies have well organized systems that can ensure the progress of work .

S Seldom do they have a stressful workload .

S The starting points of innovation in skunkworks and conventional technology are different .
A 2 3|||R:NOUN:NUM|||point|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Innovation in skunkworks is made for solving the potential problems or needs of life .

S However , Conventional is made for solving the existed problems or needs .
