S Some of the illnesses and disorders include Alzheimer 's disease , chronic disease such as hypertension and diabetes and cataract .

S However , as the technology become more and more advanced , countries will be able to tap into the newer technologies and develop more elderly friendly inventions that eventually ease and slower the aging process .
