S Although no treatment has been discovered to cure such illnesses , the only way is to improve and come up with new innovative technology to help ease the current aging process .

S Although critics argue that technological inventions have helped to ease the aging process , this however , may not be the case .

S In overall , technological inventions may be a great help to the elderly .

S However once the elderly becomes over dependent on technology , they will be at a loss once the device is unable to respond to its correct state .
A 4 5|||R:VERB:FORM|||become|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
