S In fact , it will be more efficient to limit spending on the old and use more money on economic development .

S First of all , it can not be ignored that there will be more choices to care for those who are in need with sufficient economic growth .

S For instance , Cambodia possessed a very slow development for a long time .

S With a large population living in poverty , its government spent quite large amounts of money on the needy .
