A 13 14|||R:NOUN:NUM|||amount|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S The situation is similar for the problem of aging population .

S If more efforts and money are spent on the development of economy , there will be much more benefits gained from it in turn .

S Therefore , we are provided with more choices to care for the elder people .

S Secondly , it is not necessary for governments to spend too much money on the elder to resolve the problem of aging population .
A 15 16|||R:MORPH|||elderly|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Alternatively , by requiring people to provide in advance for their own old-age dependency , governments can also solve this problem without slowing down economic growth .

