A 23 23|||M:DET|||a|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 26 27|||R:VERB:SVA|||shows|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S ( HumanWare Group , 2009 ) With these technological inventions , the aged may be able to read and write like young people .

S Hence , the pressure of aging process is reduced .
