S Alternatively , the Nobel Peace Prize laureate , Mohamed ElBaradei , proposed that these countries could construct hundreds of small-scale plants for a single town ; each one built using a fraction of the cost used for a large-scale plant and without using expensive power grid ( Bullis , 2005 ) .
