S At the Munich Maintenance Center , the night before normal operation , the acoustic sensor picked up an error of 1.1mm .

S The regulation states that the maximum allowed error was 0.6mm .

S Yet , the maintenance crew did not bother to repair or replace the wheel , assuming that it would only cause discomfort throughout the journey ( JST , 2009 ) .
A 26 29|||U:OTHER||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

