A 1 2|||U:VERB||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 9 9|||M:DET|||the|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S This claim is based on the fact that lead is not reactive with water and air .

S As an addition point , lead is inexpensive , in theory .
A 2 3|||R:MORPH|||additional|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

