A 12 13|||R:MORPH|||abundant|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S ( Microsoft Encarta Online Encyclopedia , 2009 ) .

S If we take in the consideration of the supply and demand theories , lead will be more costly as the demand soars , just like what happened to the crude oil .
A 28 29|||U:DET||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S In contrast , sodium which is more abundant will experience less effect on its price when the demand soars .

S Furthermore , sodium-cooled reactor benefits from the researches which were done earlier .
