A 20 21|||R:NOUN|||factors|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S The strong technological backup provides adequate safety ; the specific innovational design of the system ensures high work efficiency ; the ultra long lifetime and early delivery brings comparatively lower cost .

