S Psychologiststhe new gatekeeper of engineering design

S In a modern society , engineering design products are everywhere around us .

S I t is true that those products provide us with much convenience ; however , at the same time , there are also chances that it brings some dangers as side effects .

S Chernobyl explosion is one example showing the seriousness of those dangers .
