S However , some psychologists argues that those rules are not enough as all the procedures are carried out by human , there is possibility that a human error may occur .
A 4 5|||R:VERB:SVA|||argue|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 19 20|||R:NOUN:NUM|||humans|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
