A 3 3|||M:DET|||an|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Psychology in design processes , whose significance has been showed in this accident , should be paid more attention to in the future engineering design .
A 21 22|||U:DET||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Only in this way , can the safety of projects be improved efficiently and guaranteed .
