A 18 19|||U:PREP||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Unlike the VHTR which uses rare gas Helium as coolant , the SCWR simply uses water to cool down the system .
A 9 9|||M:DET|||a|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S As a result , the SCWR costs much smaller amount of money to build and greatly simplifies the nuclear plant .
