S According to statistics provided by the World Coal Institute , the remaining coal and natural gases reserves will only be able to last us for around 122 years and 42 years respectively .

S Due to vast development and urbanization in both developed and developing nations , these resources are rapidly depleted to generate electricity in power plants .

S Henceforth , to meet the world 's energy needs , scientists are re-addressing the potential benefits from harnessing power through nuclear reaction , in which uranium is splitted to release energy .
