S And they think it is not a good business in terms of the cost to make this reactor run properly and safely .

S Although some of the technological problems have not been conquered , the current research and data can tell us that we are not far from those aims .

S Through more research , we can make this proposal come true .

S Firstly , people wonder whether scientists can find a suitable material that can withstand such high temperature , more than 1000 , comparing to that of the current nuclear reactor which is less 330 .
