S Scientists can use a certain way to significantly increase the thermal property .

S They can even get a kind of materialZrCwhich has a melting point of 3540 .

S ( James W. Sterbentz , n.d. ) .

S It is estimated that the first VHTR can be built around 2020 .

S If the research in the material is financially supported well , this material obstacle will be overcome by that time .

S Secondly , some people concern about leaking of radioactivity after a period of running although the reactor maybe good enough to hold all radioactivity inside at the beginning .
