S Scientifically speaking , this problem belongs to the life of material area .

S As mentioned in the last paragraph , the material that will be used to build the reactor can withstand the high temperature .

S Consequently , the only aspect left is the corrosion factor .

S The most serious corrosion factor is due to the radiation .

S That is why engineers have set the timeline to replace some certain parts of the reactor that maybe not safe after some years .
