A 4 5|||R:MORPH|||concerned|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Ever since the partial reactor meltdown at Three Mile Island in 1979 and the Chernobyl nuclear accident in 1986 , the public feared that any similar incidents will have grave consequences to the people living around the nuclear power plant .
