S As a result , there is an improvement of 15 percent in electrical power output without increasing the temperature of the fuel salt .

S Secondly , with nuclear power being a dangerous source when explosions happen , safety has always been a concern throughout the world .

S The MSR handles the situation by having excellent safety measures to handle emergencies .
