A 14 15|||R:VERB:SVA|||have|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S People have incurred much loss in terms of money and lives in various engineering accidents and they will not want to experience any disaster anymore .

S While research has shown that most of the causes are due to human error , people are able to solve this problem by using psychology .

S Human errors are unavoidable , but psychology is meant to reduce the effect caused by human errors to the minimum point .
