A 6 10|||R:OTHER|||note|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 32 33|||R:SPELL|||convincing|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S When talking about cost issues , we should consider the long-run cost or the annual cost , which is more scientific and rational .

S Although GFR costs more than SWCR according to the budget report , the life of GFR is also longer .
A 9 10|||U:NOUN||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
A 10 11|||R:NOUN:NUM|||reports|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S In another word , GFR plant can work a few decades longer than SWCR .
