S Nuclear fuel can last longer than fossil fuel in power production and can provide much more energy .

S Also , it is cleaner regarding the global warming problem .
A 3 10|||UNK|||helps ease global warming|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S On the contrary , there are still some concerns on using nuclear energy : The most important one is about the safety of nuclear power plant its potential radioactive pollution .
