S In addition , the effectiveness of its utilization of nuclear fuel also contributes to its low cost if it is launched into production .

S Therefore , SFR benefits more with its lower cost than VHTR .

S In conclusion , Sodium-cooled Fast Reactor has a more consummate security system than Very-High-Temperature Reactor to insure its safety .

S And , the difference between the performance of SFR and VHTR is minimized .

S In addition , the low cost of SFR exactly benefits a lot for its economic requirement and fetches up the difference of its performance .

S Considering above aspects , SFR can meet the future requirement better .

