S There are some special scenarios where no amount of logical preventive measures could prevent accidents from happening , but as far as this study is concern , the devastating loss of human life and the collapse of Hotel New World could have all been avoided with the use of psychology during the design process , eliminating the errors done by humans in the design and maintenance phase .
