S Therefore , further research and development funding for nuclear reactors is necessary for our society since it is a good way to solve the energy offering problem .
A 25 26|||U:VERB||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S As the world 's energy demand is on the rise , the world has to look into alternatives to solve this issue .

