A 19 20|||R:MORPH|||economic|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Comparing with other forms of Generation IV reactors , the SCWR does not require high development cost as it is using existing technologies such as Light Water Reactors ( LWRs ) and supercritical fossil-fired boilers .
A 19 21|||R:VERB:TENSE|||uses|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

