S In order to produce efficient thermal energy , it needs to operate over the cutting point of water ( 374 degree C , 22MPa ) .Therefore we called it supercritical water-cooled reactor .

S The supercritical water ( 510-550 degree C ) is used to protect the water from boiling at temperature up to 500 degree C which directly drives turbine , without any secondary steam system .

S There are two designs called pressure vessel and pressure tube are involved .

