S Nuclear energy is a source of energy which originates from the splitting of uranium atoms in a process called fission .

S At the power plant , the fission process is used to generate heat for producing steam , which is used by a turbine to generate electricity .

S ( Westinghouse Electric Company LLC , 2009 ) Nuclear energy started in 1942 .

