S Despite the benefits of nuclear energy , few nuclear reactors have been built in the past few decades in many countries due to public opposition .

S Nuclear leak is the fear that most people have after the Bhopal incident which occurred in 1984 .

S It continues to evoke strong emotions even after 25 years later .

