S Advantage of Nuclear Power .

S As the worlds ' population grows ever larger , the worlds ' energy consumption also increases ; hence a sustainable energy source needs to be found to supply developing countries and others with enough energy .

S The world 's natural resources are depleting and a clean and renewable energy source is required .

S 16 % of the world 's electricity is supplied by nuclear power plants , and 30 % of the worlds fossil fuels are used to produce electricity .
A 19 20|||R:NOUN:POSS|||world 's|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

