S In my opinion , deficiency in psychology guidance were the main causes , as the accident would be prevented if decision makers act more rationally and the concerns of engineers from { Morton Thiokol } [ HYPERLINK : http : //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morton_Thiokol ] and Rockwell International were recognized .
