S As far as am concerned , the use of psychology may help prevent the tragedy , but it 's far from enough .
A 3 3|||M:PRON|||I|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Rather , developing high technology and taking proper safety precaution when the accident happened are more important .
