S With the fast development of high-technology , more energy is needed both for industrial use and for home use .

S Nuclear energy as a more efficient method to produce electricity attracts many scientists ' attention .

S In 2000 , The Generation IV International Forum ( GIF ) , an international collective representing government of 13 countries , was initiated .
A 14 15|||R:OTHER|||cooperative project|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0
