A 9 11|||U:OTHER||||||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S " It builds on more than 300 reactor-years experienced with sodium-cooled fast neutron reactors over five decades and in eight countries ( World nuclear association , 2008 ) " .

S Scientists from Japan also concerned about the chemical reaction between sodium and water .
A 3 4|||R:OTHER|||have also been|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S They add double-wall piping to their Japanese sodium-cooled fast reactor ( JSFR ) to improve the security of the reactor .

S Nuclear weapon and terrorism are always sensitive topics to both government and ordinary people .
