S Out of the six new reactors , Very High Temperature Reactor ( VHTR ) is the most favorable .

S It is known for being more environmental friendly and less hazardous .

S Nuclear power is encompassed by four main factors .

S These factors are economic benefits , security , safety and effects on the environment .

S Firstly , the cost of operating and starting cost of a VHTR is truly subjective .
