A 9 10|||R:VERB:TENSE|||be extended|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S In this way , SFR can competitively serve markets for electricity .

S In conclusion , plant design should be streamlined for technically sound , robust , passively safe , and low-cost production .

S Despite challenges within steps of the nuclear fuel cycle that do exist , it can be solved with improvements in technology and with global cooperation .
