A 34 35|||R:MORPH|||focused|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Psychological factors such as accountability , responsibility and professionalism play an important role in every design process .

S Potential in major accidents can in fact be recognized through the use of hazard identification and risk analysis .

S This allows the designs to be robust , independently checked and regularly reviewed .

S When there is a strong safety psychological awareness culture , accidences could have been prevented !
