S Nature Vol 429 Wapedia , Wiki : Very High Temperature Reactor ( { http : //wapedia.mobi/en/Very_high_temperature_reactor ? t = 2.3 } [ HYPERLINK : http : //wapedia.mobi/en/Very_high_temperature_reactor ? t = 2.3 ] .

