S The current trend towards early retirement in industrialised countries is largely the result of public policies that have encouraged early withdrawal from the labour force ( WHO , 2002 ) .Therefore research and development is essential to change such policies .

S Based on research , when people work longer , it can offset increasing costs for public pensions due to the rising of the eligibility age of it .
