A 8 12|||R:OTHER|||has also been done|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S As such , the elderly need not be as reliant on the community as before .

S Thus , there need not be more burdens on the family and the community brought about by the ageing process .

S However successful these policies may turn out to be , there are still contestations as to whether these policies are truly effective , and how it may actually bring in other sets of problems .
