S " Blood is thicker than water " .

S Indeed , if one possesses an allele that might develop into a crippling ailment , one should not remain silent as family members can help to share the burden ( Morin & Huot , 2004 ) .

S This may also lower the risk of developing stress-induced illnesses such as cancer as well ( Morin & Huot , 2004 ) .

S Relatives prone to the disease can also take necessary precautions to prevent the illness from developing ( Cancer.net Editorial Board , 2009 ) .

S Yet , not everyone might have freedom to do so , fearing that family members might not be able to accept the news .
