S Advancement in science , especially in the field of genetic and biomedical research , has made genetic testing possible for people to test for diseases which relate to hereditary links .

S Genetic testing , a testing that looks at a person 's genetic makes up , is able to confirm diagnosis of individuals who are at risk of certain genetic disorders like the Huntington 's disease , { cystic fibrosis , Tay-Sachs disease , breast cancer and so } [ HYPERLINK : http : //www.nature.com/scitable/topicpage/Diagnosing-Down-Syndrome-Cystic-Fibrosis-Tay-Sachs-646 ] forth .
