S After knowing of possible genetic condition , one may think twice before deciding to conceive a child .
A 3 3|||M:DET|||a|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S The rate of abortion upon learning of fetus defection will then decrease , hence preventing meaningless loss of lives .

S Likewise , obligation of carrier to tell his or her relatives allows those who indeed will suffer from dormant genetic diseases or are suffering from genetic condition to plan their lives ahead .

