S But for diseases with no preventative measures , would you want to know if you were affected or not ?

S Many adult-onset genetic disorders are progressive and have long-term health consequences .

S Thus , when a person is at risk for such a disorder , he or she may consider undergoing genetic testing .

S When the consequences of the specific disorder in question are treatable , most people would agree that genetic testing makes sense .

