S The second type of disorder is the multifactorial and polygenic disorder .

S Genes inherited play a role in such a disorder too but lifestyle and the environment are influential factors as well ( Richard , 2003 ) .

S Heart diseases and diabetes are categorised under this type of disorder .

S Again , disorders of such type puts lives at stake and therefore carriers should be obligated to convey the results of the genetic test to his relatives .
