S Oregon National Primate Research Center successfully came up with a technique that could stop future generations from inheriting genetic diseases from their parents .

S ( Henderson , 2009 ) If a carrier of a genetic risk were to hide his or her condition , the genetic disease will continue to run in the family line , passing down to future generations .
