S Surveillance technology is increasingly important in the fast-paced and ever-changing world .

S Surveillance technology refers to the measure of monitoring , identifying and tracking people , animals or products .

S Surveillance technology such as RFID which is radio frequency identification has been a popular debated issue from Chang ( 2006 ) , Michael and Rose ( 2007 ) and Gautam ( 2006 ) .
