S Firstly , the use of surveillance technology threatens our human right of privacy .
A 11 12|||R:PREP|||to|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Surveillance technology allow others to monitor our daily activities and record these data in the form of CCTV ( closed-circuit television ) images , communication records and content enabling them to have access to our personal information .

