S In addition , according to the Universal Declaration of Human Rights Article 12 , it states that " no one shall be subjected to arbitrary interference with his privacy , family , home or correspondence " ( United Nations , 2009 ) .

S Thus , since surveillance technology infringes our privacy , it should not be used to track people .
A 6 6|||M:PREP|||on|||REQUIRED|||-NONE-|||0

S Secondly , surveillance technology breaks social relationship and family bonds due to the loss of trust .

