S Secondly , the application of surveillance technology has found its use in sports .

S With the RFID tag being clipped on runners ' shoes , organisers can record the running time of every runner easily and accurately .

S It brings great ease to the organisers of the marathon races in which there are so many contestants .

S The reason why it is so difficult to track and record accurately in the past is that in such a big event , it may take about one hour for certain runners to even reach the starting point and start the race .
