S Fourthly , we have seen the application of surveillance technology in health care to tag its patients .

S The purpose is to make sure the medical records actually tally with the patients being described .

S It can provide information such as patients ' allergies and it is extremely crucial to ensure correct association .

S Critics may argue that we can also use wrist bands in which there are barcodes on the patients .

