S Therefore , it is crucial for the existence of such technology so that we can live in a safer environment .

S Secondly , surveillance technology can also be used to prevent theft .

S Cameras installed in shops allow shop tenders to observe the behaviours of customers .

S Also , items are tagged with RFID chips which have unique serial number .
