S It indeed has brought great convenience and efficiency in attending to the needs of patients .

S However , the use of RFID not only poses a threat to the patient , but to everyone around it .

S Study showed that when active RFID tags were shifted around 41 important health devices such as pacemakers , they interfered the devices in 34 tests out of all 123 tests .
